            "review_title": "Review at Mat Xi Mum",
            "review_text": "LuisSilveiro\nMuscat, Oman397 contributions\n0\nHang out with the Beautiful People\nSep 2016 • Friends\nSince serious foreign money started coming to Bien Hoa, a huge number of young people have had more and more cash to spend on having fun and, at present, Vo Thi Sau street is the place to be in Bien Hoa. It's packed with flashy neon-lit restaurants without any of the unnecessary seediness of Saigon. Mat Xi Mum is a prime example of typical, fun, delicious Vietnamese food made for Vietnamese. The place is humming with beautiful girls and boys. There's seafood, hot pot, grilled fish. Everything moving along with lots of beer. It's not a quiet romantic place, but it's perfect for people watching and for good food at decent prices. Expect to pay around 350,000D for a full meal (5 dishes) with drinks for 3 people.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 1, 2016",
